#: scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84b74e4b77a24026090ef9fcd01fe01ec6b5465f95f6facad0637f5bfa03e569
#. default-sha256: 24626f5e50228f7bc5c99e8b6c0f06043ab5b8aa203c6ed2e8bddb8fdeee61e8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was, as you ascertained, created by Morgana’s mind as it broke down in that tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come tu hai appurato, sono stata creata dalla mente di Morgana,⟪k:1⟫dopo che il suo spirito "
"si è infranto in quella torre."

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67bf7da18fd9c4848ba1a0ec817944c7f59736bf44249c9a599fa07cbaf3c81a
#. default-sha256: fb2d4c156885fcabb77982d8705e21408acba374b069d6b77f1ab32168f841b9
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fact that she viewed herself as a saint only served to amplify that agony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il fatto che vedesse se stessa come una santa non aveva fatto altro che amplificare "
"quell’agonia."

#: scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0547865323069d5459c8118f06431be8a02feff2dcb7b3aca4d134193fd5030a
#. default-sha256: 099ea569121881a5f4d5167b9b3ded8bf9692543f5a811b5ff402c132d28ca8f
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wanted to hate them, but her identity would not allow her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Those two "
"conflicting aspects of her self tore Morgana apart.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was unable to withstand it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voleva odiarli, ma la sua identità non glielo permetteva.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quei due aspetti "
"contrastanti della sua persona, hanno portato Morgana alla rottura.⟪k:3⟫ Non riusciva a "
"sopportarlo."

#: scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15a4da19eb07fde6c582ad60d99fca557f7b3218c1703dc2bdb0d6a4fc41d143
#. default-sha256: be35d90c6396eb45ef0f0f0c913428ef6a20efb60e159c1c6d5de81acf04b397
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When you came to the mansion and resurrected Morgana,⟪k:1⟫you resurrected me as well. ⟪k:2⟫"
"But I had no “self” at first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando sei arrivato alla villa e hai resuscitato Morgana,⟪k:1⟫hai resuscitato anche me. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Ma inizialmente non avevo alcuna identità."

#: scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21484f498cbeb57ac348349b97bbcd7ab7f3d98774b11d1d7aa3289ce5d0dd9c
#. default-sha256: 6673270434c7adc8228dbe881df3e26d61cb70dba63e6b0700a2f84c982d8b25
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was, I suppose, not much different than the particles of dust floating around the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Immagino... ⟪k:1⟫che non fossi tanto diversa dai granelli di polvere che fluttuavano per la "
"villa."

#: scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77815bcfd0a3c0d189ba947c764d3a172c5111f0859bea59a07fc915a4b00433
#. default-sha256: e04dcff47c152591fa2fca2f7fd232c1b2ef241f61cb01b434a7734d6d48f15a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and descended into the realm of man and the fate which governs it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e discendendo nel regno degli uomini, governato dal proprio destino."

#: scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d7d78ea670b3befb74a07d96e0ec674455b66b12268fbdc5d8988f8ce0c9680
#. default-sha256: 17fdebd57fbfd2973188995db030219e665852cf2f27ccc34741cb8e13cab377
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you think the first thing a new soul wishes for when it is born, Michel?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Quale pensi che sia la prima cosa che una nuova anima desidera appena nasce, Michel?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_CB0407A9_E339_4D48_B7DA_0AE8D959EE69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
