#: scenario9:scenario9_D4862E8D_0992_442C_82B4_6E6CBBB09432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b25327e6e451c1659fb9c512b8eb3a0e41dbce96f1c6c8c45c040dbb34d8d7b
